  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The number of elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "32",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>15</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;gives&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;solution</p><p>Similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;gives&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;solution</p><p>hence, total elements in set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn></math></p>",
